{
  "name": "Mariage - RSVP - Webhook to Notion + Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "rsvp-mariage",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-trigger",
      "name": "RSVP Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Nom Complet": "={{ $json.body.fullName }}",
            "Present": "={{ $json.body.attending }}",
            "Adultes": "={{ $json.body.adults }}",
            "Enfants": "={{ $json.body.children }}",
            "Email": "={{ $json.body.email }}",
            "Message": "={{ $json.body.message }}",
            "Date Soumission": "={{ $json.body.submittedAt }}"
          },
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "Nom Complet",
              "type": "string",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "displayName": "Nom Complet",
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Present",
              "type": "string",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "displayName": "Present",
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Adultes",
              "type": "number",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "displayName": "Adultes",
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Enfants",
              "type": "number",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "displayName": "Enfants",
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Email",
              "type": "string",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "displayName": "Email",
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Message",
              "type": "string",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "displayName": "Message",
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Date Soumission",
              "type": "string",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "displayName": "Date Soumission",
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            }
          ],
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": true
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "google-sheets",
      "name": "Google Sheets - Append RSVP",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [550, 200],
      "credentials": {}
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "databasePage",
        "operation": "create",
        "databaseId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": ""
        },
        "propertiesUi": {
          "propertyValues": [
            {
              "key": "Nom Complet|title",
              "title": "={{ $json.body.fullName }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Present|rich_text",
              "textContent": "={{ $json.body.attending }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Adultes|number",
              "numberValue": "={{ $json.body.adults }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Enfants|number",
              "numberValue": "={{ $json.body.children }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Email|email",
              "emailValue": "={{ $json.body.email }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Message|rich_text",
              "textContent": "={{ $json.body.message }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "notion-create",
      "name": "Notion - Create RSVP Entry",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.notion",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [550, 450],
      "credentials": {}
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Mariage Hannah & Alan - RSVP Workflow\n\n### Configuration requise :\n1. **Google Sheets** : Ajouter credentials + configurer le Document ID et le Sheet\n2. **Notion** : Ajouter credentials + configurer le Database ID\n3. **Activer** le workflow pour que le webhook soit accessible\n\n### Colonnes Google Sheets attendues :\n`Nom Complet` | `Present` | `Adultes` | `Enfants` | `Email` | `Message` | `Date Soumission`\n\n### Proprietes Notion attendues :\n- Nom Complet (Title)\n- Present (Text)\n- Adultes (Number)\n- Enfants (Number)\n- Email (Email)\n- Message (Text)\n\n### URL Webhook (apres activation) :\n`https://alan-ohayon.app.n8n.cloud/webhook/rsvp-mariage`",
        "width": 450,
        "height": 500
      },
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-150, 100]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "RSVP Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Google Sheets - Append RSVP",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Notion - Create RSVP Entry",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveDataErrorExecution": "all",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "all"
  }
}
